																		Love at Long Last
															</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-sage-evergreen" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6043564); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6043564&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607914464" alt="Dr Sage Evergreen" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6043564)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-sage-evergreen" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6043564); return false;" >Dr Sage Evergreen</a></span> <span class="odate time_1607857492 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">13 Dec 2020 11:04</span>
														</div>
